OL,3,AFinal James Bond screen tests to take
OL,4,Aplace this weekend, reports say
OL,5,
OL,6,FCallum Turner, Jack Lowden and Josh
OL,7,FO'Connor are among the actors thought
OL,8,Fto be taking part in final auditions to
OL,9,Fplay James Bond, according to reports.
OL,11,FScreen tests are said to be taking
OL,12,Fplace this weekend, possibly as early
OL,13,Fas Friday, according to the Hollywood
OL,14,FReporter, with between three and five
OL,15,Factors understood to have reached the
OL,16,Flast stages of the process.
OL,18,FThe finalists are said to be taking
OL,19,Fpart in auditions with three components
OL,20,F- stunts, camera presence and dialogue.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
